# Mirror lower-level targets at the top level

When adding a target to a lower-level Makefile, also expose it in the root `Makefile` as `<dir>.<name>.<target>`:

1. Add to `.PHONY`
2. Add a help line
3. Add an explicit forward target (no `%` — see makefile-no-wildcard-targets)

```make
services.vpr.ingest-ram:
	$(MAKE) -C services/vpr ingest-ram
```
